id: lab-coat
name: Lab Coat
kind: crafting
categories: standard-clothing
slots: 1
# "A Skill of your choice (when creating this piece of Apparel) ... The Skill must use your
# Scholarship Score to be chosen."
chooses: skill
choiceAttribute: scholarship
prerequisites: Scholarship Score of 4+
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Scholarship Skill chosen when it is made: its Checks 2 higher. Needs a Scholarship Score of
  4+ in whoever wears it.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: one line to an effect, typed.
summary: >
  passive: Skill Checks with the chosen Scholarship Skill: Dice Score 2 higher.
text: >
  Lab Coat: This type of clothing is intended to protect you from chemical spills and other
  scientific mishaps.
  –Apparel Category: Standard Clothing
  –Prerequisites: Scholarship Score of 4+
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase your Dice Score on Skill Checks with a Skill of your choice (when creating
  this piece of Apparel) by 2. The Skill must use your Scholarship Score to be chosen.

---

# The Skill is asked when the Quality is added, among those that use the Scholarship Score,
# and kept with it. "Your Dice Score on Skill Checks": the roll, not the Skill Bonus.
#
# Only while the wearer meets the Prerequisite: "not applied to the crafter, but the wearer".
[passive]
if (scholarship.score >= 4) {
  skill.$choice += 2;
}
